<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Anglogold details interim dividends.</title>
<headline>Anglogold details interim dividends.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo American Corp of South Africa Ltd on Thursday detailed interim dividend payments by its gold mines as follows:</p>
<p>- Free State Consolidated Gold Mines Ltd : 105 cents;</p>
<p>- East Rand Gold and Uranium Co Ltd owned by Anglo American Corp : 65 cents;</p>
<p>- Elandsrand Gold Mining Co Ltd : 60 cents;</p>
<p>- Vaal Reefs Exploration and Mining Co Ltd : 755 cents;</p>
<p>- Western Deep Levels Ltd : 295 cents.</p>
<p>NOTE - All payable September 19, on register August 8.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
